<title>BELGIUM: EU monetary committee meets on single currency.</title>
<headline>EU monetary committee meets on single currency.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's monetary began a one-day meeting on Tuesday to put key decisions on a common currency into legislative form.</p>
<p>Sources said work on an agreed stability and growth pact and a new exchange rate mechanism will be among the items discussed.</p>
<p>Belgium's economic convergence plan is also on the agenda, as is a review of recent economic developments.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 2 287 6830</p>
</text>
